# roboscope host Pi: cloud-init off. It applies the Imager's settings on a fresh card's
# first boot (before this file exists) and afterwards only costs boot time (~2.5 min of
# the 3B+'s first boot was cloud-init, 2026-11-26).
# cloud-init checks only that this file exists; the text is for people.
# Deployed from the roboscope repo (hardware/host_pi/rootfs); edit it there, not on the Pi.
